+**A green result carries; red and unknown do not** (owner 2026-10-14). A test's result is reused wherever the same
+test is asked of the same content: its identity is `[test reach digest, external-input digest, evaluator]`, the key
+`seon.test/select` reuses by on one branch. A run that records a terminated green retains it in `seon.cache` under
+that identity (`seon.test.runner/retain-greens!`); a request on any branch whose member has that identity answers
+from it, or on a cache miss from main's records in one batched query (`seon.test/carried-greens`), and records the
+member on its own branch with `:seon.test.member/reused-run` naming the run that executed it, so that branch holds
+its own green evidence (`seon.test/verified?`, `seon.cluster.branch-evidence/branch-evidence`) and later requests
+reuse it there. An explicit rerun executes. A red or unknown result is reused only on the branch that recorded it.
+Full suites run only when asked for.
